WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.578
Welcome to Data Analysis Basics. Every analysis starts with a good question.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.509
Specific: the average price of a cup of rice at one market this month.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:15.278
Measurable: you can collect numbers or categories to answer it.

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:19.688
Useful: the answer helps someone make a decision.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:23.750
Then plan what you will record, how often, and who will record it.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:34.133
Before you move on, check: Write one specific, measurable question. Say who the answer will help. List the data you need to record.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.484
In the next lesson: Spreadsheets basics.
